Thought: Test a simple mean combination on pool2 to see if a smaller robust subset improves over the best single model.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a dba combination on the smaller, more robust pool1 to see if the iterative robust method can beat the best single model.  

Action: evaluate_strategy  

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

